      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. (I was just about to request this myself if there wasn't already a request for this.)\n\nIn the long term, this might not be necessary once the queue has emptied and the vast majority of avatars already have impostors created, leaving just new avatars/content and people tweaking their impostor using VRCImpostorSettings.\n\nIt would still be nice to have.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "66d79be1d05cd914fcf1d0f3",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f2cba5631807b34c94a38e1",
        "alias": "Yellowwood Ostrich",
        "aliasID": "65c279a6ed6eefce4c459017",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/2f516b480fda774de0c22f804d379473.png",
        "created": "2020-08-07T02:20:06.853Z",
        "name": "Wunder Wulfe",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "651f00c29b934e9c99db0b22",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2024-09-03T23:29:37.452Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "655d2c0058837c8af97d6e0f",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I heavily agree. Firstly, the daily upload limit is really restrictive and limits how creators can test and make corrections on impostors\n\nSecondly, impostors may fail without reason or have issues such as severe clipping problems or sprites may be missing or placed incorrectly, and it is difficult to see and fix these issues when they cannot be inspected up close, nor quickly re-generated\n\nLastly, it would allow for impostors to be generated with a unique mesh designed to enhance its appearance as an impostor, such as a version with no skin underneath the clothes, or with enhanced mesh detail to compensate for reduced texture detail\n\nOverall, would love to see this in action in the SDK to help reduce reliance on cloud server for computation, especially if the implementation is GPU-optimized and can calculate quickly on modern NVIDIA or AMD hardware",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
