      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just being able to trigger the imposter generation inside the sdk control panel should be enough, and when the generation completes you should be able to preview it inside the unity editor (perhaps a custom scene for it?)\n\nHaving to go to the website for advanced features like this while everything else is accessible inside the sdk control panel is just annoying)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "69d73365c53873a8abb75ac0",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "69c5953abcda4ee632b97692",
        "alias": "Successive Beetle",
        "aliasID": "69c5953bbcda4ee632b989d1",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/f9fcebc6db25fd5450d015b5724dad3e.png",
        "created": "2026-03-26T20:21:14.777Z",
        "name": "NyakumaEmi",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "651f00c29b934e9c99db0b22",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2026-04-09T05:04:37.491Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "deletedAt": null,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "655d2c0058837c8af97d6e0f",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bumping this, as it's been over a year and imposters are now non-experimental and are on track to replace fallbacks since mid-2025.\n\nHaving at least some sort of preview in Unity for impostors before uploading would be very useful.\n\nI've witnessed multiple people's avatar imposters be unintentionally generated with the clothing toggled off, due to the way that some clothing toggles are set up.\n\nAnd it can be frustrating for users debugging and adjusting imposters due to the 10 impostors generation per day limit on the VRChat website.\n\nBeing able to generate imposters on your own hardware (provided, if your hardware is capable / strong enough to generate imposters, I'm not sure what the requirements for this would be) would help streamline the current imposter fine-tuning process significantly.\n\nCurrently, seeing the results of changes made to the VRCImpostorSettings and the VRCImposterEnvironment on a VRChat avatar means:\n\n1 - Signing into the VRChat SDK in Unity\n\n2 - Re-uploading the avatar again with the new or adjusted VRCImpostorSettings and VRCImposterEnvironment components.\n\n3 - Logging into the VRChat website after the new upload is finished.\n\n4 - Deleting the old imposters on the VRChat website.\n\n5 - Generating new imposters.\n\n6 - Waiting for the generation to finish (this can take as little as a few minutes or longer depending on the avatar's complexity).\n\n7 - Once it's done generating, opening VRChat on desktop / in VR / on your phone or tablet to preview the generated imposter in your menu.\n\n8 - Repeating this whole process over again if you don't like how the imposter turned out, until having to wait until the next day if you manage to generate 10 imposters in one day.\n\nCurrently, there's no way to preview generated imposters directly on the VRChat website or in Unity, so viewing them in VRChat in-game is the only way to preview them.\n\nProviding a button to push inside Unity to generate the imposters, like others have said, would reduce the amount of friction involved in generating imposters, which currently involves remembering to go login to the VRChat website directly after uploading an avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "69d736ccb378a11a57c3515d",
