      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Remember to click the upvote button at top of this page, to the left of the \"SDK Client Side Imposter Preview\" title of this post if you want to show your support for generating imposters through the SDK on your own hardware!\n\nCommenting under the main original post as well will also help show support for this feature if you want this :3!\n\nEven a simple \"Bump!\" or \"Agreed!\" comment helps push this and other feedback requests like it onto VRChat's radar and potentially their future roadmap / get a feedback request marked as 'Tracked' or at least 'Interested'.\n\nBe sure to upvote and comment the other feedback posts linked in this post if you are interested in seeing those be implemented / updated as well!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
